  "notes": "{崇|あが}める means to worship or idolize, implying deep reverence.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n\nREGISTER:\nFormal or literary. For casual contexts, use ⟦{大好|だいす}き→大好き：02911_daisuki⟧ or ⟦ファン→ファン：10065_fan⟧.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{神|かみ}→神：02147_kami⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{崇|あが}める: to worship a god\n- ⟦スター→スター：00393_sutaa⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{崇|あが}める: to idolize a star\n- {崇|あが}められる: to be worshipped/idolized\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{崇拝|すうはい}→崇拝：10032_suuhai⟧: worship, adoration (noun)\n- ⟦{尊|たっと}ぶ→尊ぶ：10025_tattobu⟧: to respect, to value\n- ⟦{敬|うやま}う→敬う：00417_uyamau⟧: to respect, to honor",
